{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PUNCH TV</strong> is the ultimate team fight show! You get to focus on the combat without the chaos. Compete with the best, solo or multiplayer!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964520/extras/3d6b3c9632d72ef30515fd548ba0d3ff.poster.avif?t=1755753525\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964520/extras/3d6b3c9632d72ef30515fd548ba0d3ff.webm?t=1755753525\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964520/extras/3d6b3c9632d72ef30515fd548ba0d3ff.mp4?t=1755753525\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>STORY</strong>\u00a0Ascend the tower of champions, sixty-five stages of varying challenges and game modes (FFA, 1 on 1, Tag Teams). Story mode is designed as a single player, progression based experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FIGHTERS</strong>\u00a0of every shape and combat style, <strong>55</strong>\u00a0playable! Fireballs, piledrivers, spinning kicks, backfists, suplexes, leg sweeps, rapids, beasts, robots, shotos and everything in between, one of the most competitive rosters of fighters you'll find anywhere! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PVP</strong> online with your team of 3 fighters against players from around the world or against AI.  <strong>ALL PVP Characters have balanced stats, there is no 'pay2win' for this mode.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>COOP\u00a0</strong>in real time, fight together with up to 3 players online in a series of coop-only stage battle.  A Four Fats multiplayer experience! We offer everyone 9 fighters for free so you can pick up and play!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964520/extras/063fec79615343c8a4e87817686411c6.poster.avif?t=1755753525\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964520/extras/063fec79615343c8a4e87817686411c6.webm?t=1755753525\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964520/extras/063fec79615343c8a4e87817686411c6.mp4?t=1755753525\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964520/extras/ebe7d701c4444960d69b00dbd5af2e59.avif?t=1755753525\" width=286 height=202 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3964520?t=1755753525","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964520/3c726884cdaca19b1e7996695aef6b6dcbb63388/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1755753525","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964520/e706d058cef8748434828a2ef4cfc4890a79e4ea/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755753525","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964520/e706d058cef8748434828a2ef4cfc4890a79e4ea/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755753525","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Cross-Platform Multiplayer","id":27},{"description":"In-App Purchases","id":35},{"de